{"id": 3994, "name": "Richfield Township Campground", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://richfieldtownship.org/parks-rec/", "lines": [" a one stop summer fun park. | Reservations | Reservations are accepted up to 6 months in advance – The Campground is open from April 1st to October 31st with both Rustic and Modern Campsites. | Rates | Modern Sites are $45 a night which includes electric (20, 30 and 50 amp hook up) & water. Rustic Sites are $25 a night. Prices are subject to change. | Modern Sites | Includes electric 20, 30 and 50 amp Electrical Box", " are 2 pavilions, along with a play area located beside the East Pavilion. These pavilions can be rented through the Clerks office all forms are located on website. | Dock Fees & Availability | The price for a season is $1100 for a dock spot and the location is lighted and has its own parking area separate from the beach area. For Dock spot availability call Richfield Township in December at 989-389-4994 EXT. 5. | La", "ful perks make this a great location for a few fun hours or a long day out on our 2400 acre all sports lake. | Boat Launch | The Boat Launch provides two docks for launching boats. | Boat Launch Passes are available for $20 per year and are available at the Richfield Township Hall. | Registration / Pay envelopes are also available at the access site, along with a pay tube. | Yearly passes will be mailed to the addres"]}, {"url": "https://richfieldtownship.org/supervisor/", "lines": [], "via": "Supervisor"}, {"url": "https://richfieldtownship.org/lake-conservatory-committee/", "lines": [], "via": "Lake Conservatory Committee"}, {"url": "https://richfieldtownship.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/1-Map.pdf", "pdf": true, "via": "Campground & Park Map |"}, {"url": "https://richfieldtownship.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Richfield-Township-Parks-Survey.pdf", "pdf": true, "via": "Richfield Township Parks Survey |"}]}
