{"id": 4016, "name": "O.B. Fuller Park and Campground", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://deltacountymi.gov/parks/fuller-campground/", "lines": []}, {"url": "https://deltacountymi.gov/veteran-services/", "lines": [], "via": "Veteran Services"}, {"url": "https://deltacountymi.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/parks-OB-Fuller-Park-Map-2026.pdf", "pdf": true, "via": "Campground Map"}, {"url": "https://deltacountymi.gov/parks/rates-fees-policies/", "lines": ["orest-land Policies and Regulations | Delta County Parks & Recreation Day Use Regulations (Full Version) | Parks and Recreation Commission Bylaws | CAMPGROUND RATES & FEES: | Daily Rates | Basic (Electric &Water ONLY) – $40 per night | Full Hook-up (Electric, Water & SEWER) – $45 per night (Pioneer Trail Park ONLY, Sites ) | River/Lake View Sites – $45 per night | Rustic Forest Tent Site, no electric – $25, 14 day-ma", "mission Bylaws | CAMPGROUND RATES & FEES: | Daily Rates | Basic (Electric &Water ONLY) – $40 per night | Full Hook-up (Electric, Water & SEWER) – $45 per night (Pioneer Trail Park ONLY, Sites ) | River/Lake View Sites – $45 per night | Rustic Forest Tent Site, no electric – $25, 14 day-maximum stay | Holiday weekends require a 2- day minimum for prior booking. | Spooktacular (September 18-20) at PTP rates incur a $5 ", "iver/Lake View Sites – $45 per night | Rustic Forest Tent Site, no electric – $25, 14 day-maximum stay | Holiday weekends require a 2- day minimum for prior booking. | Spooktacular (September 18-20) at PTP rates incur a $5 upcharge a day for Friday & Saturday. | Extended Stays (Monthly) Rates | Pioneer Trail Park Basic (Electric & Water ONLY Sites) – $900 per 30 day stay | Fuller Campground Basic (Electric & Water ON", "- day minimum for prior booking. | Spooktacular (September 18-20) at PTP rates incur a $5 upcharge a day for Friday & Saturday. | Extended Stays (Monthly) Rates | Pioneer Trail Park Basic (Electric & Water ONLY Sites) – $900 per 30 day stay | Fuller Campground Basic (Electric & Water ONLY Sites) – $900 per 30 day stay* | *Fuller Campground Lakeview Sites 18-26 During July & August (Electric & Water ONLY) – $950 per 3", "lectric & Water ONLY Sites) – $900 per 30 day stay | Fuller Campground Basic (Electric & Water ONLY Sites) – $900 per 30 day stay* | *Fuller Campground Lakeview Sites 18-26 During July & August (Electric & Water ONLY) – $950 per 30 day stay | ​ | Seasonal Rates | Must have signed Seasonal Site Agreement: Please call office for booking a Seasonal. (Monday through Friday) | 5 MONTHS (157-night stay) | Fuller Campground", "y | ​ | Seasonal Rates | Must have signed Seasonal Site Agreement: Please call office for booking a Seasonal. (Monday through Friday) | 5 MONTHS (157-night stay) | Fuller Campground Basic (Electric & Water ONLY Sites) – $2,750 | Pioneer Trail Park Basic (Electric & Water ONLY Sites) – $2,750 | Pioneer Trail Park Full-Hookup (Electric, Water & Sewer) – $3,250 | Cabin Rentals ( Maximum occupancy 6 people per cabin ) | ", "| 5 MONTHS (157-night stay) | Fuller Campground Basic (Electric & Water ONLY Sites) – $2,750 | Pioneer Trail Park Basic (Electric & Water ONLY Sites) – $2,750 | Pioneer Trail Park Full-Hookup (Electric, Water & Sewer) – $3,250 | Cabin Rentals ( Maximum occupancy 6 people per cabin ) | $65 per night (Pioneer with electric) | $65-$70 per night (Fuller with electric) | $50 per night (Fuller – no electric) | 2 – night mi", " – $2,750 | Pioneer Trail Park Full-Hookup (Electric, Water & Sewer) – $3,250 | Cabin Rentals ( Maximum occupancy 6 people per cabin ) | $65 per night (Pioneer with electric) | $65-$70 per night (Fuller with electric) | $50 per night (Fuller – no electric) | 2 – night minimum stay | 7 – night stay $390 (Pioneer Trail Park) (7th night free with contiguous 6 day stay) | 7 – night stay $390 (OB Fuller) (7th night free w", "lectric) | $65-$70 per night (Fuller with electric) | $50 per night (Fuller – no electric) | 2 – night minimum stay | 7 – night stay $390 (Pioneer Trail Park) (7th night free with contiguous 6 day stay) | 7 – night stay $390 (OB Fuller) (7th night free with contiguous 6 day stay) | *All cabin check ins must take place from 8:00am-8:00pm EST, with no exceptions. | ​ | Other Fees & Information | All Daily and Monthly R", "LL AT THE TIME OF THE RESERVATION! | Seasonal Rates: 50% non-refundable down-payment due by ; remaining 50% due . | MUST be 18 years old to rent a site | Reservation Fee: If a site is booked in advance, a NON-REFUNDABLE $5.00 fee is added to the total. | Credit Card Charge Policy: MINIMUM $15.00 per CREDIT CARD USE. A 4% NON-REFUNDABLE processing fee will be added to your total cost. | Cancellation Fee: $15.00 CHARGE", "ked in advance, a NON-REFUNDABLE $5.00 fee is added to the total. | Credit Card Charge Policy: MINIMUM $15.00 per CREDIT CARD USE. A 4% NON-REFUNDABLE processing fee will be added to your total cost. | Cancellation Fee: $15.00 CHARGE ( per site ). In addition, if cancellation is seven (7) days or less prior to your stay, your total reservation cost is forfeited. (NON-REFUNDABLE). | Dump Station: Included in camping f", " In addition, if cancellation is seven (7) days or less prior to your stay, your total reservation cost is forfeited. (NON-REFUNDABLE). | Dump Station: Included in camping fee. If you are not camping with us, the fee is $10.00 per use of dump station. | Shower: Included in camping fee. If you are not camping with us, the fee is $5.00 per use of shower. | Campfire Wood: All firewood brought into any Delta County Park ", "ee is $5.00 per use of shower. | Campfire Wood: All firewood brought into any Delta County Park MUST BE INSPECTED at office (or by camp host if office is closed) before taking to site. If we supply your wood, there is a $7.50 charge per bundle. Please inquire at office or when making your reservation. | Quiet Time: 11:00 PM to 7:00AM (Eastern Time) | Check-In Time: 1:00 PM (Eastern Time) Stop at the office/camp-host "], "via": "Rates/Fees/Policies"}]}
